WEBVTT

button-wrap
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.700
The button that wraps.

diff-limits
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.920
None of that shows up in a diff.

intro
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.240
Meet Arguseye. Eyes for coding agents.

real-props
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.200
Real props from your own call sites.

real-styles
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.760
Your theme, your layouts, your global CSS.

evidence
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:24.660
The agent gets back a cropped screenshot, the accessibility tree, what changed since its last render, and errors with file paths.

vscode
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.800
And in VS Code, the preview lives beside your code and updates as you type.

no-server
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.160
No dev server.

no-stories
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.180
No stories.

clients
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:38.000
It works with Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini, Copilot, any MCP client.

outro
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:41.530
Arguseye. Open source. One command to install.
